3
00:00:03.966 --> 00:00:05.308
agar... aur kabhi nahi

4
00:00:05.328 --> 00:00:06.341
ke baare mein soch

5
00:00:06.361 --> 00:00:07.935
sakte ho! Language se

6
00:00:07.955 --> 00:00:09.795
