9
00:00:12.298 --> 00:00:13.336
pe rakhi gayi! Fire

10
00:00:13.356 --> 00:00:14.673
ne humein warmth di...

11
00:00:14.693 --> 00:00:16.218
Tools ne power di...

12
00:00:16.238 --> 00:00:17.649
Lekin language ne humein...

13
00:00:17.937 --> 00:00:19.184
ek doosre ko diya!

